    "text": "By Emily Nguyen ,\n11 hours ago The ongoing struggle to manage homelessness in Portland saw a mix of concerted efforts and climate-related adjustments in the past week. According to a recent report, the Street Services Coordination Center (SSCC) worked in collaboration with various city departments to address campsites that present the most significant health and safety risks to the community. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
